icb:Property a owl:Class.
icb:SubjectOfInterest a owl:Class.
icb:belongsTo a owl:ObjectProperty.
icb:isCharacterisedBy a owl:ObjectProperty.
tribont-core:Body a owl:Class.
tribont-core:OperationProperty a owl:Class.
tribont-core:Role a owl:Class.
